      "side": 1,
      "message": "The fact that this isn\u0027t aligned to UCSI constants makes this very confusing. \n\nCan we simply reserve values 0x0 - 0xff for UCSI and add vendor specific commands from 0x100 onwards? (Or some other magic constant values if we want to keep this within uint8_t)?\n\nIt will make it easier to know which commands are pure UCSI vs modified for the PDC driver.",
      "revId": "64f7a7d8009fd6f4b4636ead5417fe02d33ae165",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
