      "writtenOn": "2024-05-20T21:00:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree with Abhishek.  There\u0027s a lot of overlap with the UCSU command definition.\n\nExtending the `enum ucsi_command_t` definition with a vendor specific range will clean up a lot of code in this file.\n\n```\nenum ucsi_command_t {\n\tUCSI_PPM_RESET \u003d 0x01,\n\t...\n\tUCSI_GET_LPM_PPM_INFO \u003d 0x22,\n\t\n\tUCSI_VENDOR_TRIGGER_PDC_RESET,\n\tUCSI_VENDOR_ENABLE,\n\tUCSI_VENDOR_GET_VBUS_VOLTAGE,\n\t...\t\n```",
      "parentUuid": "504d5cf2_236229bd",
